{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bcacf4609ff20c44135451ac8ce4e68561844fa21f7dcda4b562f0d0dec825f8", "ja": "打ち合わせの後、生徒の言葉がどうしても\n気になる海美と琴葉。ふたりは、彼女や\n聞いてくれる人達にそんな事はないのだと\n伝えるため、女の子を応援するための新曲を\n作ってほしいとプロデューサーに相談する。", "zh": "商谈后，海美和琴叶始终很在意学生说的话。为了告诉她和那些愿意倾听的人并不是那样，也为了给女孩子们加油，两人向制作人商量，希望他创作一首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fa696bf4900605faf394a182b4fb7be4869503fa01a3175acb64299bec4a25f4", "ja": "（2回目の打ち合わせも無事に終わったけど……\n海美と琴葉は、少し浮かない顔をしていたな）", "zh": "（第2次会议也顺利结束了，不过……海美和琴叶刚才似乎有些闷闷不乐啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "76ca0577eb96af45880d2786a0edabf5de8863b686634562c48ee27f93a41e32", "ja": "（相手に選ばれる、か……）", "zh": "（被对方选中吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "108d2a4fc944f1866785d31b50cd47a05a859ef392bd542f1feac9e832256d6c", "ja": "……琴葉！", "zh": "……琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "b4a137e7ee80909e9d04553f9db30def7036b1dcef195966c9ebad8f0def2a75", "ja": "……海美ちゃん！", "zh": "……海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "f8ea87a669d51f9ce55f09c4223eaa205d9f9895f781ed7204b7cc570371e052", "ja": "私、さっき、さくなちゃんたちと話してから、\nなんかずっとモヤモヤ～ってしてるんだけど！", "zh": "我啊，刚才和小咲奈她们聊完之后，\n心里就一直闷闷的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "71d8e2da3e5cde21063ca215aaaf24e94a82f3ba7518c346554d95cf7eaef1ef", "ja": "違うよって、そうじゃないよって思ったんだけど……\nでも、どう言えばいいのかわからないよーっ！", "zh": "我本来想说“不是这样的”，想说“不是那样的”，可是……我不知道该怎么说才好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "af9d155f009bca00f13d5f0e3bcb11a5e5b24b8177e53e4dcafcb95399641d9b", "ja": "うん。……私たちはアイドルで、彼女の言葉を\n借りるなら「選ばれた」側だけど……。", "zh": "嗯。……我们是偶像，借用她的\n说法就是“被选择”的那一方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "55363fce47d539a201f49e135d8ecb34763e98de4219182778d047a069cb31d5", "ja": "けど、それだけじゃないよね。\n……私たちだって、選んでいるはずだから。", "zh": "不过，不只是这样吧。\n……我们应该也在做出选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "9215e77467ad7c8c86b9f0d45622f2f44c3e6aab58d42c364da51947af2eb34e", "ja": "琴葉……うんっ、そうだよね！\n私も、好きでアイドルやってる！　ここにいる！", "zh": "琴叶……嗯，就是这样！\n我也是因为喜欢才当偶像的！我就在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "719c2c2ecb5a93100417249d330c761ce2ece18d9046abf799291e7bc8687f67", "ja": "ねえ、琴葉。さくなちゃんを応援する方法、\n何かないかな？", "zh": "呐，琴叶。有没有什么办法能支持咲奈呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "85df8954f00ff78ae7eb94fe48f251770a357d67af5740099ebd7d2e5546225c", "ja": "そうだね。想いを伝えるかどうかを\n決めるのは、さくなちゃんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。要不要传达这份心意，决定权在咲奈自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "88c9a7587eed4b8986d8cfed7d66cbe7530c690231e8d48dc88585c1da37be05", "ja": "「選ばれない」なんて理由で諦めてほしくない。", "zh": "我不希望她因为“选不上”这种理由而放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "594d74aacec577a55d1acc69c7d6767fdf5482e9b71754001432df90ba901e50", "ja": "私、さくなちゃんをがんばれって応援したいっ！\nけど、どうすればいいのかな？", "zh": "我想为小咲加油打气！\n可是，该怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "fd2e1bc54e26150190179fe4d8af356d700f4a03b9c75d1ebaf67b28fd08c1bf", "ja": "私たちが応援するなら……\n方法は、ひとつじゃないかな？", "zh": "如果是我们来加油的话……\n方法应该不止一种吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "daaedf2ed027dd1b6b66516a778c38b6f121bb43424cb166537fee6297e7de58", "ja": "あ……！　そっか！", "zh": "啊……！原来如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bbcd48cfc6a111b8a5a641ca16322d591b23b025d53b9602377ae2526f2fdba2", "ja": "お疲れさま、海美。琴葉もか。\nそんなに急いで、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。琴叶也在啊。\n这么急匆匆的，是出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "614df443fd31fa116404dbdb65158c35c48edcbaffc85b6e60cc06a939e62e5d", "ja": "うん！　あのね、急なんだけど、\nお願いしたいことがあるんだ！", "zh": "嗯！那个，虽然有点突然，\n但我有件事想拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "bfea597e91e446fb6e06db24814ca13880d6a1c5f5a5ad9c3ce0bca0c361f725", "ja": "私たちに、新曲を作ってほしいの！", "zh": "我们想请你帮我们创作一首新曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "932709e879a89d8cf913c1d002bd691b95954f6224d336106b72e99d30eff4cc", "ja": "それは……本当に急な話だな。用意できると思うけど、\n今から歌もダンスも覚えるとなると、かなり大変だぞ？", "zh": "这还真是……太突然了。不过我觉得应该能准备好，只是现在才开始学歌和舞蹈的话，可是相当辛苦的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "18a1877bb25f40c838e210f77b5de0b2abe1639947ca52fcd65781d6110c62e2", "ja": "わかっています。でも私たち、今度のステージで、\nどうしても届けたいメッセージがあるんです。", "zh": "我知道。但是，我们在下次的舞台上，有一段无论如何都想传达的讯息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "f6c5f55b40ffe2479cdbcd21bffa6ad5f43e5105edbcf28d34b84ba95b14ae28", "ja": "それを伝えるには、今ある曲だけでは難しいかも\nしれなくて……どうしても、新曲が必要なんです！", "zh": "要传达那个信息，只靠现在已有的歌曲可能有些困难……所以，无论如何都需要一首新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2c1a96dc71a74c77401d7dd393ae310f8e7f8f3197a67de795ec5991605af48a", "ja": "（ふたりとも、すごく真剣な表情だ……それに、\n届けたいメッセージか。よし、それなら……）", "zh": "（两个人的表情都非常认真……还有想要传达的信息吗。好，那样的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "06d78d4953bfeabe4c07dc07b995700ea935c048ef0cfe1896c38d143285d8b7", "ja": "ふたりの気持ちはよくわかった。\nそれなら、協力させてもらうよ。", "zh": "我很明白你们两个人的心情。\n既然这样，就让我来帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "8673f3f845005aafcb8ab88e55465e425f0d75f8c33c4d29ecfad5863f795b0a", "ja": "ホント！？\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "真的！？\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "63437acb8fc6c02cc7f0b6a7128c2f7f40d80a61930de13582f77def4cacecc1", "ja": "ありがとうございます、全力でがんばります！\n{$P$}、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "非常感谢，我一定会全力以赴的！\n{$P$}，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4dccb5f310e1b5852972ae9b889fcecdd38abbe07551311493040aff2963c9ad", "ja": "それで、届けたいメッセージがあるんだったな？\nどんな曲にしたいのか、イメージを話してもらえるか。", "zh": "所以，你是有想传达的信息，对吧？\n能跟我说说，你希望这首歌呈现出怎样的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "0bfeae15d5208a9dbfce8aa97807cb653ad12e82fb8c49d41bb2534949e4eb69", "ja": "うん！　あのね、女の子が笑顔になれる曲が歌いたい！\n会場のみんなに、いーっぱい元気になってほしいんだ！", "zh": "嗯！那个……我想唱一首能让女孩子们露出笑容的歌！\n我希望会场里的大家都能打起满满的精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "0789b7366513dd90225dde4909f5e99c6ba41b42e8b3d77ec08a7bf562bb0da5", "ja": "それと……聞いてくれた子が、自分の気持ちに\n素直になれるような、そんな曲にしたいです。", "zh": "还有……我想创作出那种能让听到这首歌的女孩子，坦率面对自己心情的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "47a0e061007bc607cda0b88cb355b39bc3cfdad2a25b53ae852cfe48ede11954", "ja": "もっとワガママに、自由になっていいんだよって。\n私たち、そういうメッセージを届けたいんです。", "zh": "我们想传达这样的心意：你可以再任性一点，也可以更加自由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "798a47faed86f5985472dcd5f7d79f3979e16897c782b9e7befd8f99223515ec", "ja": "ワガママにか……。もしかして、\n打ち合わせで話してた事と関係あるのか？", "zh": "任性一点吗……难道和我们开会时聊到的事情有关？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "baf18b658e907759bbaa1b0153d0669bf9095df0e9b8f3b500c76eec0478723d", "ja": "はい。……選ばれないから諦めるなんて、\n言ってほしくないんです。", "zh": "是的。……我不希望听到“因为没被选中，所以就放弃”这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "8ef8f4da76b846bc91073a91172478fc489847c7cc545fb1be53aa87ccb73fbe", "ja": "選ばれるだけでなく、自分が選んでもいいんだって。\nそういう強い気持ちがあることを、伝えたいんです。", "zh": "我想告诉大家，不只是自己被选中，也可以由自己来选择。想把拥有这种坚定心情的事传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "4bf76c9873c9ba7de2d906afacec78b3932d63cf450c66b13974fe9605d60466", "ja": "そうか。ふたりの気持ちは、よくわかったよ。\n他には、何か希望はあるか？", "zh": "这样啊。我很明白你们两个人的心情了。\n还有什么其他的要求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "df4e3e5a4080ff76eeb5af750dfddfd2c1e07f6fd793b0057e4759ca0a319935", "ja": "……うん、こんなところかな。\nこれだけあれば、すぐにオーダーできると思う。", "zh": "……嗯，差不多就是这些了。\n有这些的话，应该马上就能下单了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
